---
---
<section id="pricing" class="pricing">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h2>Planes a tu medida</h2>
      <p>Elige el plan que mejor se adapte al tamaño de tu clínica.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pricing-grid">
      <div class="pricing-card">
        <h3>Básico</h3>
        <div class="price">$0<span>/mes</span></div>
        <p>Para veterinarios independientes.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Hasta 50 pacientes</li>
          <li>Agenda básica</li>
          <li>Soporte por email</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#" class="btn">Comenzar gratis</a>
      </div>
      <div class="pricing-card featured">
        <div class="badge">Popular</div>
        <h3>Pro</h3>
        <div class="price">$29<span>/mes</span></div>
        <p>Para clínicas en crecimiento.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Pacientes ilimitados</li>
          <li>Inventario completo</li>
          <li>Reportes avanzados</li>
          <li>Soporte prioritario</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">Prueba gratuita</a>
      </div>
      <div class="pricing-card">
        <h3>Clínica</h3>
        <div class="price">$59<span>/mes</span></div>
        <p>Para múltiples sucursales.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Todo lo de Pro</li>
          <li>Multi-sucursal</li>
          <li>API para integraciones</li>
          <li>Capacitación personalizada</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#" class="btn">Contactar ventas</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .pricing {
    padding: 10rem 2rem;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    position: relative;
  }
  /* Curva de entrada (Top) */
  .pricing::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: -50px;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 50px;
    background: #ffffff;
    clip-path: ellipse(50% 100% at 50% 100%);
  }
  /* Curva de salida (Bottom) */
  .pricing::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -50px;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 50px;
    background: #ffffff;
    clip-path: ellipse(50% 100% at 50% 0%);
    z-index: 2;
  }
  .container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }
  .header h2 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    color: #1e293b;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .header p {
    color: #64748b;
  }
  .pricing-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .pricing-card {
    background: #f8fafc;
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }
  .pricing-card:hover {
    border-color: #cbd5e1;
    transform: translateY(-5px);
  }
  .pricing-card.featured {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 2px solid var(--primary);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
  }
  .badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 1rem;
    right: 1rem;
    background-color: var(--primary);
    color: white;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .price {
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #1e293b;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }
  .price span {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #64748b;
  }
  .pricing-card h3 {
    color: #1e293b;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }
  .pricing-card p {
    color: #475569;
  }
  .pricing-card ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 2rem 0;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .pricing-card ul li {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: #475569;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .pricing-card ul li::before {
    content: "✓";
    color: var(--primary);
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .btn {
    display: block;
    padding: 0.875rem;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    color: #1e293b;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .btn-primary {
    background-color: var(--primary);
    border-color: var(--primary);
    color: white;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover {
    filter: brightness(0.9);
  }
</style>
